terms and our position with respect to them.

Licence tags below were read from the Hugging Face API and the upstream
repositories on 2026-08-04, not from memory or from a summary. Where a source
declares nothing, this file says so rather than guessing.


1. What is NOT redistributed here
---------------------------------

No question, document, context passage or candidate answer from any source
benchmark appears in this repository or in the verdict data it produces.

A verdict record carries only: the instance identifiers, the gold label, the
stratum and category, a content-addressed join key, the judging condition and
format, our model's parsed prediction, and our model's raw generation. The
generations are our own model outputs, not source text.

The join index (dataset_index/) carries one-way SHA-1 digests over question,
context and candidate. A digest does not reproduce its input; it lets a third
party who has independently obtained a benchmark verify that our identifiers
line up with theirs.

This is a deliberate design choice, not a happy accident. It is what allows the
measurements to be published under our own terms whilst leaving every source
benchmark to be obtained from its own publisher, under its own licence.

As of 2026-08-04 there is no exception: nothing third-party is redistributed
here. See section 3 for the one file that previously was.


